WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:09.780
<i>The countless flowers,
enveloped in light…</i>

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:20.330
<i>…gaze at tomorrow
with unwavering eyes.</i>

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:39.350
<i>Everyone wishes for me to be pure…</i>

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>…but what can I bring
with me to the frayed skies?</i>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:53.900
<i>What I’ve made my own
by breaking off flowers in bloom…</i>

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.510
<i>All such sinful things…</i>

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:06.980
<i>Why did I stop making
promises with the future?</i>

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:14.260
<i>Because even if I try
to run far from all the pain…</i>

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:20.990
<i>…a cold wind rustles
my hair… Don’t you see?</i>

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>Where can I ever find the answer?</i>

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:37.860
It’s the enemy!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.700
They’ve spotted us!

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.210
Retreat at full speed!

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:07.720
The fact that the enemy Simouns
showed up in battle today…

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:12.570
…was a taunt to let us know
they can attack us at any time.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:16.610
And that’s exactly
what they’re capable of.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:27.540
<b>Eternal Maidens</b>

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:32.250
So it’s really over now?

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.480
The war, that is…

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.110
Yes.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:39.990
So now we can finally devote our
lives to just offering prayers?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.150
Yes.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:44.070
Yeah, but…

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:46.120
Why is it that it doesn’t
make us feel better?

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.890
I want to see that other world.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.900
The one that Grandpa was
always yearning to see.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.530
A different world than this one…

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:30.950
That’s why I became a sibylla,
so I could get there!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.160
But now…

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.330
Amuria…

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:40.130
Then does that mean that Amuria
may also be alive somewhere?

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.140
That won’t do.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.180
Vice Chancellor?

00:04:55.270 --> 00:05:00.400
Please don’t call me that.
That is no longer my title.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:06.110
Though its life may have ended…

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:10.240
…this flower can still
provide solace at least.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:20.110
Didn’t you attend the ceremony?

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.130
No.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.760
The war has ended.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.260
And that means it’s all over now.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:31.390
Still provide solace, did I say?

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.270
But I no longer have the power to do so.

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:40.060
I can no longer protect my Neviril.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.150
What?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.440
What did you say?

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.990
Those are the two conditions set by…

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:50.240
…Shoukoku and the Plumbum highlands
in exchange for the ceasefire.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.280
Nobody ever thought to inform me!

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:56.770
We’re to be treated as their
equals, if only on the surface.

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.750
And just whose doing would that be?

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.480
Think about it carefully.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.250
“War is foolishness…”

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:08.260
Isn’t that right, High Priestess?

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:18.190
The military governors from
Plumbum and Shoukoku have arrived.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.400
Ah, we have been waiting for you…

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.890
Is this really how
things should turn out?

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:38.960
Yes.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:40.540
I…

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:45.530
All I ever wanted was for the sibyllae
to continue praying to the skies.

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.670
Nothing more…

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.720
But with this change…

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:53.890
Anubituf…

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.390
The way the high priestess
was acting just now…

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.470
What?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.890
Never mind.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.520
Why are they still around when
the peace ceremony is over?

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:14.990
I heard that some of their forces
are staying on the Arcus Prima.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:18.410
The more I think of it, the less I
understand what this “peace” is about.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.770
There’s nothing we can do about it.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:26.670
Until they found the ancient Simouns,
it was their comrades who were dying.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.010
So this is what they
look like in person.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.260
Roatreamon…

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:40.680
All those faces that we
extinguished with our Ri Majons…

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:43.060
We never even knew
what they looked like.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:44.310
I’m sure…

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:45.360
I’m sure…

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.360
…they didn’t know what
we looked like either.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.300
Well, the food’s
getting cold. Let’s eat!

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:55.100
Here, Roatreamon, have some of my fish.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:59.120
You’re getting too thin, you know!
You have to get more nourishment.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.540
Right.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:01.620
Thank you!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.170
Vura, you sound like her mom!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.670
Do I?

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.130
Your legs are in the way!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.530
Get those filthy legs
of yours out of our way!

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.620
Yeah, I know you can’t understand
a word I’m saying, but…

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.810
Huh? I see that you
know I’m insulting you!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.080
You…

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:58.200
Please forgive us,
Sibylla Aurea Neviril!

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:01.060
We have committed an unspeakable sin!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.100
Neviril?

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.060
I bless you. Go in peace…

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.110
Bless us?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.070
I bless you all…

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.760
Neviril…

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.130
Hey, you’re in the shower too?

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:19.640
Yes.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.430
Can I borrow your soap?

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:22.640
Sure.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.640
Wow, yours are pretty huge, aren’t they?

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.650
What are?

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.270
They’re always getting in my way.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.990
Oh, right. Because you’re
going to become a man, right?

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:42.910
I have to become a man, or…

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:44.830
I have to become strong, or…

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.250
I can never protect what’s dear to me.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.920
You know what? Neviril
told me something once…

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:58.760
To become strong by being held…
You’re wrong about that, Alty.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:04.100
It’s only when you’ve
both become strong…

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:07.020
…that you can truly
hold each other close.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.310
I see…

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:12.730
I see!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:16.400
I always thought I wanted
to become a man too.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.360
But now I think I can manage
without making that change.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.620
Big Sister…

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:37.130
You should accept yourself as you
are. Your life will be easier then.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.620
Onasia!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:14.510
Onasia, how did you get here?

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:17.130
I know you were at the Ruins,
so how in the world…

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.630
If you believed that to be true,
then why did you come here?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:23.630
Well…

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:27.470
This is an extremely
unstable place to be.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:32.100
The Ruins served as the
training grounds for Chor Dextra.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:38.650
So many abortive Emerald Ri Majons
exploded into oblivion there.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.490
The helical motors…

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:45.160
…are believed to
manipulate time and space.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.410
Yes.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.830
And because of this, Space
and Time were distorted…

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.660
…causing the Spring to exist
simultaneously in two different places.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:58.500
I find all of this hard to believe.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:04.760
There are very few things that
people can actually believe…

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:10.930
…when they are unable
to believe in themselves.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.920
It’s as you say.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:23.780
I wanted to be near my comrades
who had fallen in battle…

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:28.820
…yet I was also trying to flee
as far away from them as possible.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.950
But how did you know that?

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.620
Because I was the same way.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:41.230
I shied away from making a choice…

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:44.760
…and tried to run as far
away from reality as possible.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:49.510
Perhaps I’ve been seeking
you out all this time.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.640
Perhaps I wanted…

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.230
…to have someone hear my confession.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.390
To hear…

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.400
…my sins…

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:10.550
One of the conditions of our peace
treaty with Plumbum and Shoukoku…

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:13.370
…calls for the
dissolution of Chor Tempest.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:37.870
Where did Yun run off
to at a time like this?

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:38.940
I know…

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.880
I don’t want any part of this!

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:41.980
Roatreamon?

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.690
Chor Tempest, disbanded?

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.150
After all the effort we
put into it until now?

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:52.490
The Plumbum priestesses will be
taking over our duties, right?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:55.650
I’m confused. Is this what peace is?

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:58.000
We can never hope to be on equal terms.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:02.000
But I don’t understand!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.540
One thing’s for sure.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:10.880
They have no use for
us anymore. That’s all.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.750
Just when we finally
started to understand…

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.150
…the true meaning of
our prayers as sibyllae.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.650
Even after Chor Tempest
ceases to exist…

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:31.400
…nothing can change the fact
that we’re all Simoun sibyllae.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:37.740
And nobody will ever debase our prayers.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.500
Nobody!

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.390
If Chor Tempest is disbanded…

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.850
Huh? What’s this, all of a sudden?

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:08.710
…we won’t be able to
fly the Simouns anymore.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.820
The door to that other world…

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.360
…will be closed to us.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.990
You’ve always longed to see
that other world, haven’t you?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.080
In that case…

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.630
I don’t remember you being so talkative.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.840
What?

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.690
Never mind.

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:30.800
Aer!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.140
Aer!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.820
We haven’t talked like
this in a long time.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:50.820
No.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.720
Neviril…

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:58.740
What?

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.160
Would you…

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:05.170
Would you give me your blessing too?

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.210
What?

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.010
Of course I will!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.010
Neviril…

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.520
Aer?

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.400
What’s going on? Sulking, are you?

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.030
Did you have a fight with Neviril?

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.700
Huh? Why are you
asking me about Neviril?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.790
Right on the money, huh?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.830
Neviril…

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.060
She’s changed.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:48.420
What do you mean?

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.670
She talks up a storm now.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:54.860
Well, you can always use
your mouth to stop her!

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:57.050
Boy, kissing is all you
ever think about, Floe!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:01.300
You told me it’s when you really like
someone that you want to kiss them.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.060
So don’t you want to kiss her?

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.810
Not the way Neviril is now.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.770
Don’t you like her anymore?

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.780
Ha! You’re just jealous.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:18.610
No, I’m not! Huh?

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.430
What’s going on? I feel hot all over!

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:23.330
Oh boy, you’re in critical condition!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:26.330
Hold up! What do you mean, critical?

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:28.290
It might not just be Neviril, you know?

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:30.790
It could be that you’ve
changed as well, Aer.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.310
Sibylla Neviril!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:56.820
Where is Sibylla Aer? Where is she?

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:58.240
High Priestess!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.780
What is it, High Priestess?

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:05.080
I suppose you’ll do, Sibylla
Paraietta. Come with me!

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:08.290
Follow me. Please. Hurry!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.070
High Priestess?

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:21.180
You must take off now, Sibylla
Paraietta, Sibylla Neviril!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.210
What?

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:26.100
There’s no time to lose! You must
go at once! If you don’t hurry…

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:30.100
…the door will close on us!
Never to open again!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.270
The door?

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:38.300
A long time ago…

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:41.110
…I was a member of Chor Dextra.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.610
What?

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.370
I dreamed of completing
the Emerald Ri Majon.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:49.120
I dreamed of becoming an eternal maiden.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.620
Eternal maiden?

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.250
A Simoun is much like a maiden herself.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.130
A maiden vacillates…

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:02.680
The Simoun gem reflects
that vacillating soul.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:06.140
A maiden drifts…

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.430
Escaping reality for all eternity…

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:16.520
Tracing the skies with
her everlasting beauty…

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.670
Please slow down, Your Eminence!

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:38.920
The Emerald Ri Majon!

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:42.170
You must change Kyuukoku’s fate!
We cannot go on like this!

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:43.680
Unless we do something about it, we…

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.040
Hurry! You must go now!

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:52.180
To the Land of Hope!

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:24.420
You’re keeping something
from me, aren’t you?

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.890
I want to know what it is.

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:31.970
But…

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:36.390
I want to hold you.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.400
As your friend.

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:42.570
Paraietta…

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.780
Allow me to show you.

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:50.410
When one flees from reality…

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:53.660
…refusing to choose a gender…

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.620
…this is what becomes of you.

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>It is played by my wounds…
the song of prayer.</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:52.100
<i>Let it ring out over
the grieving universe.</i>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:59.140
<i>Can we change tomorrow?
Don’t be afraid.</i>

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.780
<i>I want to let you know
how my heart’s overflowing.</i>

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:19.640
<i>“I want to get closer to you.”
“I want to feel your pulse.”</i>

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:24.820
<i>I was too defiant,
and I took the long way around.</i>

00:23:24.820 --> 00:23:28.780
<i>The blue moon is swaying silently.</i>

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:32.820
<i>My true heart’s desire is you.</i>

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:38.700
<i>I can’t reach you.
My tears of pain trickle down.</i>

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:44.240
<i>Soar away into the sky, song of prayer.</i>

00:23:44.240 --> 00:23:47.670
<i>Carrying my love that came too late.</i>

00:23:47.670 --> 00:23:53.340
<i>What can I do to change tomorrow?</i>

00:23:53.340 --> 00:23:59.580
<i>Just hold on to “now” the way it is…</i>

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:06.660
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:24:06.660 --> 00:24:10.090
Neviril bares her soul to Aer…

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.630
…and the other sibyllae make
their way towards the Spring.

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:15.510
Next time on Simoun…

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:20.020
<b>Choices</b>

00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:18.060
Choices.
